<title>USA: Cirrus Logic named in shareholder suit.</title>
<headline>Cirrus Logic named in shareholder suit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cirrus Logic Inc has been hit with a class action suit filed in California Superior Court for Alameda County on behalf of purchasers of the company's common stock from October 1, 1995, through February 14, 1996, lawyers for the plaintiffs said Monday.</p>
<p>Defendants are Cirrus and certain of its officers and directors.</p>
<p>The complaint alleges fraud and deceit, and negligent misrepresentation by, among other things, misrepresenting and/or omitting information concerning demand for Cirrus's 32 bit and 64 bit products, said a statement issued by the plaintiffs' law firm.</p>
<p>The statement did not specify the amount of damages sought.</p>
</text>
